                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Nice horror game! Bought it on a whim at some point because it was Brazilian/had Brazilian's folclore in it. Finally decided to play it and was glad on my whim. It's short, but good and I liked the puzzles and investigation. It had been a while since I'd played a point and click and it reminded me I'm a sucker for it lol (even if I can't never find the objects in the background properly)\n\nMust admit I did have a bit of trouble with the item menu for a second and wished there was a very brief tutorial of it in the beginning.\n\nStill pretty good game, very unusual. I love games that deal with my awesome country and its folklore, and was really happy to like a horror one with this theme. And I was very nervous about the freaking beast following me, so everything worked well lol",
